---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
const title = 'Privacy Policy | Betapixel';
const description = 'How Betapixel Studios LTD collects, uses and protects personal information from quotes, orders, artwork and analytics, and your rights under Kenyan law.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} crumbs={[{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy Policy', path: '/privacy-policy/' }]}>
  <article class="section--tight">
    <div class="wrap article prose legal">
      <h1 class="h1-body">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="article-meta">Last updated: <time datetime="2026-09-24">24 September 2026</time></p>
      <p>Betapixel Studios LTD respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal information you share with us when using our website, requesting a quotation, placing an order, or communicating with us.</p>
      <p>This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, why we collect it, how we use it, and your rights regarding your personal information.</p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We may collect information that you provide directly to us, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your name</li><li>Phone number</li><li>Email address</li><li>Company or business name</li><li>KRA PIN, if you choose to give it for invoicing</li><li>Billing and delivery information</li><li>Details relating to quotations and orders</li>
        <li>Artwork, logos, images, designs, documents, and other files you submit for printing or design work</li><li>Messages and enquiries you send to us</li><li>Payment and transaction information</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Our website may also collect basic technical information such as your browser type, device information, IP address, pages visited, and website usage data through cookies or similar technologies.</p>

      <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We may use your information to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Process and fulfil your orders</li><li>Prepare quotations and invoices</li><li>Communicate with you about your order or enquiry</li><li>Deliver products and services</li><li>Provide customer support</li>
        <li>Process and verify payments</li><li>Improve our website, products, and services</li><li>Maintain business, accounting, and transaction records</li><li>Prevent fraud or misuse of our services</li>
        <li>Meet legal, tax, regulatory, and accounting requirements</li><li>Send promotional communications where you have consented or where permitted by applicable law</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Artwork and Customer Files</h2>
      <p>When you send us artwork, photographs, logos, designs, documents, or other files, we use them for the purpose of providing the requested service.</p>
      <p>We do not claim ownership of customer-supplied artwork or intellectual property.</p>
      <p>We may retain production files for a reasonable period to make repeat orders, corrections, or customer support easier. You may ask us to delete files that contain your personal information, subject to any legal or legitimate business record-keeping requirements.</p>

      <h2>4. Sharing Your Information</h2>
      <p>We do not sell or rent your personal information.</p>
      <p>We may share information with trusted third parties where necessary to operate our business or complete your order. These may include:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Payment service providers</li><li>Delivery and courier companies</li><li>Website hosting and IT service providers</li><li>Accounting and professional service providers</li>
        <li>Printing or production partners where required to fulfil an order</li><li>Government authorities where disclosure is required by law</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We only share information that is reasonably necessary for the relevant purpose.</p>

      <h2>5. Payments</h2>
      <p>Payments may be processed through banks, mobile payment providers, payment gateways, or other payment service providers.</p>
      <p>These providers may process certain personal and financial information according to their own privacy policies and legal obligations.</p>
      <p>Betapixel Studios LTD does not intentionally store complete bank card details unless this is required and handled through an authorised payment system.</p>

      <h2>6. Cookies and Website Analytics</h2>
      <p>Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to help the website function, understand how visitors use it, and improve your browsing experience.</p>
      <p>Some cookies may also be used for analytics or marketing where applicable.</p>
      <p>You can control or disable cookies through your browser settings. Some website features may not function correctly if certain cookies are disabled. See our <a href="/cookie-policy/">Cookie Policy</a> for details.</p>

      <h2>7. Marketing Communications</h2>
      <p>Where permitted, we may use your contact information to tell you about Betapixel Studios LTD products, services, offers, or updates.</p>
      <p>You may ask us to stop sending marketing communications at any time.</p>
      <p>Transactional communications relating to quotations, invoices, active orders, payments, or customer support may still be sent when necessary.</p>

      <h2>8. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect personal information against unauthorised access, loss, misuse, alteration, or disclosure.</p>
      <p>No internet-based system can guarantee complete security, but we take reasonable steps to protect information under our control.</p>

      <h2>9. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>We retain personal information only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purpose for which it was collected, to maintain business records, resolve disputes, process repeat orders, or meet legal and regulatory requirements.</p>
      <p>Information that is no longer required may be deleted, anonymised, or securely disposed of.</p>

      <h2>10. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Subject to applicable Kenyan data protection law, you may have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Ask what personal information we hold about you</li><li>Request access to your personal information</li><li>Ask us to correct inaccurate or incomplete information</li><li>Object to certain uses of your personal information</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent where processing relies on your consent</li><li>Request deletion of personal information where legally applicable</li><li>Request restriction of certain processing</li><li>Exercise other rights available under applicable data protection law</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To make a privacy request, contact Betapixel Studios LTD using the contact details provided on our website.</p>

      <h2>11. Third-Party Websites</h2>
      <p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites or services.</p>
      <p>Betapixel Studios LTD is not responsible for the privacy practices, content, or security of third-party websites. You should review their privacy policies before providing personal information.</p>

      <h2>12. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>Our website and commercial printing services are not intended to knowingly collect personal information directly from children without appropriate consent where consent is required by law.</p>
      <p>If we become aware that personal information has been collected in circumstances where appropriate consent was required but not obtained, we will take reasonable steps to address the matter.</p>

      <h2>13. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy when our business practices, website features, or legal requirements change.</p>
      <p>The latest version will be published on our website with the date of the most recent update.</p>

      <h2>14. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>For questions, requests, or concerns relating to this Privacy Policy or your personal information, contact:</p>
      <p>Betapixel Studios LTD<br />Nairobi, Kenya<br />Website: betapixels.studio<br />Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>
      <p>You may also contact us using the contact information provided on our website.</p>
      <p class="small">© 2026 Betapixel Studios LTD. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
